      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you mean to create a new DBus interface in adhd similar to the \"org.chromium.bluetooth.BluetoothMedia\" defined in src/third_party/adhd/cras/src/server/cras_fl_media.c ?\n\nafaiu, the UHID open and close should affect the CRAS Floss media object.",
