      "writtenOn": "2023-09-22T15:49:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi @whalechang@google.com, any blocker of exporting yet another callback interface from CRAS?\nIn case that\u0027s not allowable, hi @enshuo@google.com, probably we may merge the Telephony and the Media interface together given that they actually share the same underlying structure, WDYT? No concern from my side.",
      "parentUuid": "8bf66a0a_94e8a5e3",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 191,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 193,
        "endChar": 46
