        "id": 2012120
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-09-25T10:38:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we only add callback, then add another interface is overkill to me. However, if eventually we find out we actually need a many callback for telephony in CRAS/Floss. Then we should definitely add another interface to support it.",
