      "writtenOn": "2023-09-26T04:36:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e If we really want to share the same underlying structure, we should think about why CRAS needs to know this information.\n\nJust want to clarify - They are shared *now*. Both `IBluetoothMedia` and `IBluetoothTelephony` are implemented for `BluetoothMedia`. BT Telephony is actually a subset of HFP from the perspective of both BT Spec and Android API, and we store all objects together. Merging the 2 interfaces should be straightforward.\n\nThe only reason that I defined the Telephony interface before is probably: The concept of Telephony is not applicable on CrOS and I don\u0027t want to export the experimental API through a stable (Media) interface. So now I don\u0027t have a strong reason to keep them separated (yet no strong reason to merge them though).\n\nBut anyway we need to keep the API clear. I don\u0027t think exporting Telephony callback through Media API is a good idea.",
      "parentUuid": "e31e0312_867d822a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 191,
        "startChar": 0,
